+/// `scan_page` obeys all four of its normative rules (proposal 0016 decision 4,
+/// `crates/traits/src/lib.rs`): byte-lexicographic order, an **exclusive** cursor, `next`
+/// `None` **only** on exhaustion, and — walked to exhaustion — every key of the prefix range
+/// exactly once.
